	// Sub-view scroll reset must be DEFERRED past the re-render: an
	// immediate ScrollOffset write lands BEFORE the branch swap lays out,
	// and the fresh content re-clamps to the old offset (user 2026-07-05:
	// "the journal doesnt start at the top"). Same one-tick-later family
	// as detailScrollFollowPending; held a few frames so the write
	// survives the mount-frame layout too. Consumed in Tick().
	private int subViewScrollResetFrames;

